1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:07,974
Bugungi videomiz qanday? – Chet elda ishlaydigan odamning bir kuni.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sahna 1: Yangi kunning boshlanishi

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,560
Koʻzlarimni ochaman.

4
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:18,183
Oq ship koʻrinadi.

5
00:00:18,206 --> 00:00:22,073
Bu yer – Tokio.

6
00:00:22,096 --> 00:00:26,296
Mening ismim Rin.

7
00:00:26,319 --> 00:00:29,158
Men Amerikadan kelganman.

8
00:00:29,181 --> 00:00:32,352
Xona juda tinch.

9
00:00:32,376 --> 00:00:36,542
Faqat soatning ovozi eshitiladi.

10
00:00:36,565 --> 00:00:39,344
Derazani ochaman.

11
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:43,614
Sovuq shamol esadi.

12
00:00:43,638 --> 00:00:47,644
Yangi kun boshlanmoqda.

13
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:52,513
Bugun ham bu katta shaharda yashab ketaman.

14
00:00:52,537 --> 00:00:55,612
Qahva ichaman.

15
00:00:55,636 --> 00:00:58,646
Issiq ekan.

16
00:00:58,669 --> 00:01:03,002
Tayyorgarlik koʻrib, tashqariga chiqaman.

17
00:01:03,026 --> 00:01:05,966
Piyoda stansiyagacha boraman.

18
00:01:05,989 --> 00:01:09,389
Koʻp odamlar bor.

19
00:01:09,412 --> 00:01:13,246
Hammasi qayerga ketayapti?

20
00:01:13,269 --> 00:01:16,635
Hech kim meni tanimaydi.

21
00:01:16,658 --> 00:01:19,708
Biroz yolgʻizlik his qilaman.

22
00:01:19,732 --> 00:01:24,189
A, Rin-san, xayrli tong!

23
00:01:24,212 --> 00:01:28,900
A, Tanaka-san, xayrli tong!

24
00:01:28,924 --> 00:01:31,376
Bugun ham erta ekansiz.

25
00:01:31,399 --> 00:01:35,850
Ha, ertalabki havoni yaxshi koʻraman.

26
00:01:35,873 --> 00:01:38,942
Shundaymi? Yaxshi ekan.

27
00:01:38,966 --> 00:01:43,011
Tanaka-san ham har doim erta turasiz-ku.

28
00:01:43,034 --> 00:01:48,367
Ha, men ertalabki poyezdni yaxshi koʻraman.

29
00:01:48,390 --> 00:01:50,957
Odam kam boʻladi-ku.

30
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:56,580
Shunday. Toʻla poyezddan biroz qoʻrqaman.

31
00:01:56,603 --> 00:02:01,203
Yaponlar ham toʻla poyezdni yoqtirishmaydi.

32
00:02:01,226 --> 00:02:04,629
Shundaymi? Yengil boʻldim.

33
00:02:04,653 --> 00:02:07,219
Poyezd keldi-ku.

34
00:02:07,242 --> 00:02:10,279
Ha, birga boring.

35
00:02:10,303 --> 00:02:13,570
Tanaka-sanning ovozi eshitildi.

36
00:02:13,593 --> 00:02:17,926
Yolgʻizlik hissi biroz yoʻqoldi.

37
00:02:17,949 --> 00:02:21,082
Men yolgʻiz emasman.

38
00:02:21,106 --> 00:02:24,473
Bugun ham ishga boraman.

39
00:02:24,496 --> 00:02:25,996
Sahna 2: Kanji toʻsigʻi va ish

40
00:02:25,996 --> 00:02:28,533
Ofisga yetib keldim.

41
00:02:28,556 --> 00:02:30,923
Kompyuterni ochaman.

42
00:02:30,946 --> 00:02:33,919
Koʻp xatlar bor.

43
00:02:33,942 --> 00:02:36,987
Hammasi yaponcha.

44
00:02:37,011 --> 00:02:40,683
Kanji haqiqatan ham qiyin.

45
00:02:40,706 --> 00:02:44,673
Men dizayn bilan shugʻullanaman.

46
00:02:44,695 --> 00:02:47,362
Dizayn men uchun oson.

47
00:02:47,386 --> 00:02:51,157
Ammo til toʻsigʻi baland.

48
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:54,747
Baʼzan yigʻlamoqchiman boʻladi.

49
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:57,903
Katta nafas chiqadi.

50
00:02:57,926 --> 00:03:01,093
Rin-san, hammasi joyidami?

51
00:03:01,116 --> 00:03:06,249
Oh, Tanaka-san. Ha, hammasi joyida.

52
00:03:06,272 --> 00:03:10,080
Katta nafas olayotgan edingiz-ku.

53
00:03:10,104 --> 00:03:15,171
Kechirasiz. Kanji biroz qiyinroq ekan.

54
00:03:15,194 --> 00:03:17,427
Qaysi kanji?

55
00:03:17,450 --> 00:03:20,458
Bu elektron pochtadagi kanji.

56
00:03:20,482 --> 00:03:25,765
A, bu „tasdiqlash“ deb oʻqiladi.

57
00:03:25,788 --> 00:03:28,222
„Kakunin“, desangiz?

58
00:03:28,245 --> 00:03:32,578
Ha. „Tekshirish“ degan maʼnoni bildiradi.

59
00:03:32,601 --> 00:03:34,671
Tushunarli. Rahmat.

60
00:03:34,694 --> 00:03:37,227
Lugʻatdan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

61
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:40,549
Ha, doimo foydalanaman.

62
00:03:40,573 --> 00:03:44,340
Nimadir tushunmaganingizda, istalgan vaqtda soʻrang.

63
00:03:44,363 --> 00:03:48,051
Tanaka-san har doim mehribon.

64
00:03:48,074 --> 00:03:52,052
Bir jamoamiz-ku. Albatta.

65
00:03:52,076 --> 00:03:54,681
Rostdan yordam berasiz.

66
00:03:54,705 --> 00:03:57,992
Bugun tushdan keyin yigʻilish bor-ku.

67
00:03:58,015 --> 00:04:01,182
Ha, hujjatlar tayyor.

68
00:04:01,205 --> 00:04:04,538
Keyinroq koʻrsatib qoʻying.

69
00:04:04,561 --> 00:04:06,832
Tushunarli.

70
00:04:06,856 --> 00:04:11,728
Men yolgʻiz ishlamayapman.

71
00:04:11,751 --> 00:04:14,390
Yordam beradigan odamlar bor.

72
00:04:14,414 --> 00:04:18,580
Shuning uchun koʻproq oʻrganmoqchiman.

73
00:04:18,603 --> 00:04:22,883
Yapon tilini yanada yaxshi gaplashmoqchiman.

74
00:04:22,907 --> 00:04:25,240
Bugun ham harakat qilaman.

75
00:04:25,263 --> 00:04:26,763
3-Sahna: Parkda tushlik / Parkda tushlik

76
00:04:26,763 --> 00:04:29,530
Tushlik vaqti.

77
00:04:29,553 --> 00:04:32,120
Men parkdayapman.

78
00:04:32,143 --> 00:04:35,281
Bugun ob-havo yaxshi.

79
00:04:35,304 --> 00:04:37,970
Osmon juda ham koʻk.

80
00:04:37,993 --> 00:04:41,127
Amerikadagi osmonni eslatadi.

81
00:04:41,151 --> 00:04:44,518
Men bentō tayyorladim.

82
00:04:44,541 --> 00:04:48,314
Tuxumli omlet va onigiri.

83
00:04:48,337 --> 00:04:52,571
Yapon taomlari juda ham chiroyli.

84
00:04:52,594 --> 00:04:55,462
Yeyishga arziydi.

85
00:04:55,485 --> 00:04:59,285
Rin-san. Bu yer yaxshimi?

86
00:04:59,308 --> 00:05:03,395
Tanaka-san. Ha, marhamat.

87
00:05:03,419 --> 00:05:08,076
Tashqarida yeyiladigan ovqat mazali boʻladi-ku.

88
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:11,975
Ha. Shamol yoqimli.

89
00:05:11,998 --> 00:05:15,972
Rin-san, sizning bentongiz ajoyib ekan-ku.

90
00:05:15,995 --> 00:05:18,729
Oʻzim tayyorladim.

91
00:05:18,751 --> 00:05:22,362
Tuxumli omlet chiroyli.

92
00:05:22,386 --> 00:05:24,153
Rahmat.

93
00:05:24,176 --> 00:05:28,257
Lekin, taʼmi biroz xavotirda.

94
00:05:28,281 --> 00:05:31,455
Bitta olsam boʻladi-mi?

95
00:05:31,478 --> 00:05:34,377
Ha, marhamat.

96
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,268
Sinab koʻring.

97
00:05:36,291 --> 00:05:38,424
Yeyapman.

98
00:05:38,447 --> 00:05:42,614
Mmm, juda mazali.

99
00:05:42,637 --> 00:05:44,415
Rostdanmi?

100
00:05:44,438 --> 00:05:46,522
Yaxshi boʻldi.

101
00:05:46,546 --> 00:05:50,679
Bir oz shirin, juda mazali.

102
00:05:50,702 --> 00:05:54,635
Bir kun Amerika taomlarini ham pishiraman.

103
00:05:54,658 --> 00:05:57,192
Shu kunni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

104
00:05:57,215 --> 00:06:01,661
Kimdir men tayyorlagan taomni yeyapti.

105
00:06:01,684 --> 00:06:04,851
Mazali ekanligini aytishadi.

106
00:06:04,874 --> 00:06:09,240
Shu soʻzlar mening yuragimni toʻldiradi.

107
00:06:09,263 --> 00:06:15,147
Kichkina bentō qutisida mening joyim bor.

108
00:06:15,170 --> 00:06:18,747
Tushdan keyin ham ishni davom ettirishga quvvatim bordek.

109
00:06:18,771 --> 00:06:20,271
4-Sahna: Xatolar va kayfiyatni oʻzgartirish / Xatolarni yengish va kayfiyatni oʻzgartirish

110
00:06:20,271 --> 00:06:24,161
Tushdan keyin soat uch.

111
00:06:24,184 --> 00:06:27,671
Tashqarida yomgʻir yogʻyapti.

112
00:06:27,694 --> 00:06:31,698
Men qaynoq suv xonasida turibman.

113
00:06:31,722 --> 00:06:35,928
Yaqinda ishda xato qildim.

114
00:06:35,952 --> 00:06:40,235
Yapon tilining maʼnosini xato tushundim.

115
00:06:40,259 --> 00:06:44,196
Notoʻgʻri dizayn tayyorlab qoʻydim.

116
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:47,594
Juda afsusdaman.

117
00:06:47,617 --> 00:06:52,950
Oynadagi oʻz qiyofamga qaradim.

118
00:06:52,973 --> 00:06:56,507
Qaygʻuli koʻrinardim.

119
00:06:56,529 --> 00:07:00,896
Lin-san, kofe ichmaymizmi?

120
00:07:00,919 --> 00:07:03,565
Tanaka-san.

121
00:07:03,588 --> 00:07:07,922
Xato har kimga roʻy beradi.

122
00:07:07,945 --> 00:07:11,945
Lekin vaqtimiz behuda ketdi.

123
00:07:11,968 --> 00:07:14,141
Muammo yoʻq.

124
00:07:14,165 --> 00:07:18,379
Lin-sanning dizayni ajoyib.

125
00:07:18,403 --> 00:07:20,136
Rahmat.

126
00:07:20,159 --> 00:07:24,326
Men ham avval koʻp xatolar qilganman.

127
00:07:24,349 --> 00:07:26,915
Tanaka-san ham xatolar qilganmisiz?

128
00:07:26,938 --> 00:07:30,792
Ha. Shuning uchun unutmang.

129
00:07:30,815 --> 00:07:36,015
Tanaka-san, nega shunchalik mehribonsiz?

130
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:40,684
Men ham chet elda ishlaganman.

131
00:07:40,708 --> 00:07:43,241
Shundaymi?

132
00:07:43,264 --> 00:07:49,431
Ha. Til tushunmaslikning qiyinligini bilaman.

133
00:07:49,454 --> 00:07:53,220
Siz mening his-tuygʻularimni tushunasiz.

134
00:07:53,243 --> 00:07:57,046
Shuning uchun yolgʻiz yigʻlamang.

135
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:59,236
Ha. Rahmat.

136
00:07:59,259 --> 00:08:03,593
Keling, yangi dizayn tayyorlaymiz.

137
00:08:03,616 --> 00:08:06,782
Ha, darhol boshlayman.

138
00:08:06,805 --> 00:08:12,045
Derazadan yomgʻir hali ham yogʻyapti.

139
00:08:12,069 --> 00:08:17,568
Lekin mening yuragimdagi yomgʻir toʻxtadi.

140
00:08:17,591 --> 00:08:21,391
Kimdir menga qarab turibdi.

141
00:08:21,414 --> 00:08:25,892
Shunchaki shu yetarli, men kuchliroq boʻlolaman.

142
00:08:25,916 --> 00:08:27,416
5-Sahna: Taqdimotdagi ishonch va yapon tili / Taqdimotdagi ishonch va yapon tili

143
00:08:27,416 --> 00:08:31,149
Bugun muhim kun.

144
00:08:31,172 --> 00:08:35,140
Yangi dizayn boʻyicha taqdimot boʻladi.

145
00:08:35,164 --> 00:08:39,059
Qoʻlim biroz qaltirab turibdi.

146
00:08:39,083 --> 00:08:43,016
Amerikada ishonchim komil edi.

147
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:48,880
Lekin bu yerda yapon tilida gapirishim kerak.

148
00:08:48,903 --> 00:08:52,637
Til meni kichikroq his qildiradi.

149
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:56,557
Katta chuqur nafas olaman.

150
00:08:56,580 --> 00:09:00,980
Mening qurolim faqat soʻzlar emas.

151
00:09:01,003 --> 00:09:06,089
Mening qurolim – bu dizayn.

152
00:09:06,113 --> 00:09:09,127
Lin-san, tez orada konferensiya boshlanadi.

153
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:13,193
Ha. Juda asabim bo‘shamoqda.

154
00:09:13,217 --> 00:09:15,550
Dam oling, hammasi yaxshi bo‘ladi.

155
00:09:15,573 --> 00:09:19,206
Yapon tilida xato qilishim mumkin.

156
00:09:19,229 --> 00:09:23,062
Yapon tili eng muhimi emas.

157
00:09:23,085 --> 00:09:24,728
E?

158
00:09:24,752 --> 00:09:28,519
Eng muhimi – bu Lin-sanning his-tuyg‘ulari.

159
00:09:28,542 --> 00:09:31,944
Mening his-tuyg‘ularimmi?

160
00:09:31,967 --> 00:09:36,234
Ushbu dizaynga qo‘ygan his-tuyg‘uaringizni yetkazing.

161
00:09:36,257 --> 00:09:39,691
Ha, tushunarli.

162
00:09:39,714 --> 00:09:43,714
Men ham yoningizdaman, xavotir olmang.

163
00:09:43,737 --> 00:09:47,337
Tanaka-san bilan birga bo‘lsa, yuragim tinch.

164
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:50,193
Endi boramizmi?

165
00:09:50,216 --> 00:09:53,391
Ha, iltimos, yordam bering.

166
00:09:53,414 --> 00:09:56,748
Konferensiya zalining eshigini ochaman.

167
00:09:56,771 --> 00:09:59,737
Hamma menga qarayapti.

168
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:03,257
Lekin endi qo‘rqmayman.

169
00:10:03,281 --> 00:10:08,614
Ichimdagi issiq hislarimni shunday ko‘rsataman.

170
00:10:08,637 --> 00:10:13,676
Mening dizaynimga ishonaman.

171
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:17,933
Hammangiz, mening dizaynimga qarang.

172
00:10:17,956 --> 00:10:20,013
Iltimos, yaxshi qabul qiling.

173
00:10:20,036 --> 00:10:22,636
Konferensiya boshlanadi.

174
00:10:22,659 --> 00:10:26,793
Oldinga qarab turaman.

175
00:10:26,816 --> 00:10:28,316
6-Sahna: Qizil quyosh botishi va hislar / Sunset and Emotions

176
00:10:28,316 --> 00:10:32,049
Taqdimot tugadi.

177
00:10:32,072 --> 00:10:36,672
Men kompaniyaning tomida turibman.

178
00:10:36,695 --> 00:10:41,095
Quyosh botishi osmonni qizil rangga bo‘yamoqda.

179
00:10:41,118 --> 00:10:44,685
Juda go‘zal qizil rang.

180
00:10:44,708 --> 00:10:50,674
Hech kim yo‘q tom – mening maxfiy joyim.

181
00:10:50,697 --> 00:10:55,231
Shamol yuzimni silamoqda.

182
00:10:55,254 --> 00:11:01,303
Hamma mening dizaynimni maqtabdi.

183
00:11:01,326 --> 00:11:06,222
Yapon tilim yaxshi emas edi, lekin hislarim yetib bordi.

184
00:11:06,246 --> 00:11:10,658
Xursandchilikdan ko‘zlarim yoshlandi.

185
00:11:10,682 --> 00:11:14,348
Lin-san, sizni izlab yurgan edim.

186
00:11:14,371 --> 00:11:17,305
A, Tanaka-san.

187
00:11:17,328 --> 00:11:19,661
Shu yerda edingiz-ku.

188
00:11:19,684 --> 00:11:23,484
Ha, quyosh botishini tomosha qilyapman.

189
00:11:23,507 --> 00:11:28,040
Bugungi taqdimotingiz ajoyib bo‘ldi.

190
00:11:28,063 --> 00:11:30,997
Bu sizning yordamingiz.

191
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:35,053
Yo‘q, bu Lin-sanning o‘zi.

192
00:11:35,076 --> 00:11:38,131
Rostdan, katta rahmat.

193
00:11:38,154 --> 00:11:42,843
Hamma Lin-sanning dizaynini yoqtirishdi, deyishdi.

194
00:11:42,866 --> 00:11:46,400
Buni eshitib, yuragim tinchlandi.

195
00:11:46,423 --> 00:11:50,556
Endi yanada band bo‘lasiz.

196
00:11:50,579 --> 00:11:54,579
Ha, harakat qilaman.

197
00:11:54,602 --> 00:11:58,969
Charchaganingizda yana bu yerga kelamiz.

198
00:11:58,992 --> 00:12:00,725
Ha, to‘g‘ri.

199
00:12:00,748 --> 00:12:03,915
Bu manzara yoqadi.

200
00:12:03,938 --> 00:12:07,874
Endi pastga tushamizmi?

201
00:12:07,897 --> 00:12:09,664
Ha.

202
00:12:09,687 --> 00:12:14,853
Quyosh botmoqda, koʻchalarda chiroqlar yonadi.

203
00:12:14,876 --> 00:12:18,282
Tokioning kechasi boshlanmoqda.

204
00:12:18,306 --> 00:12:24,717
Yulduzlar koʻrinmasa ham, koʻcha chiroqlari yulduzdek porlaydi.

205
00:12:24,741 --> 00:12:30,975
Bu nurlar ichida biroz koʻproq harakat qilishga quvvat topaman.

206
00:12:30,998 --> 00:12:34,816
Ertaga ham yaxshi kun boʻlsin.

207
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,340
Sahna 7: Tunning doʻkon sayohati / Kechki doʻkon sayohati

208
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:39,306
Soat kechki sakkiz.

209
00:12:39,329 --> 00:12:42,581
Ofisdan chiqib, piyoda yuraman.

210
00:12:42,605 --> 00:12:47,338
Yoʻldagi salqin havo juda yoqimli.

211
00:12:47,361 --> 00:12:50,031
Doʻkonga kiraman.

212
00:12:50,054 --> 00:12:54,254
Yorugʻ chiroqlar va musiqa bor.

213
00:12:54,277 --> 00:12:59,010
Yapon doʻkonlari – sehrli joy.

214
00:12:59,033 --> 00:13:01,367
Hamma narsa bor.

215
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:05,625
Issiq choy va shirinlik sotib olaman.

216
00:13:05,648 --> 00:13:08,248
Xush kelibsiz!

217
00:13:08,271 --> 00:13:10,709
Shuni iltimos qilaman.

218
00:13:10,732 --> 00:13:13,366
Choy va shirinlik, shundaymi?

219
00:13:13,389 --> 00:13:16,322
350 yen boʻladi.

220
00:13:16,345 --> 00:13:19,878
Ha, shu bilan iltimos.

221
00:13:19,901 --> 00:13:22,040
Qaytimingiz.

222
00:13:22,064 --> 00:13:24,697
Har doim rahmat.

223
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,390
E?

224
00:13:26,413 --> 00:13:29,892
Meni eslaysizmi?

225
00:13:29,916 --> 00:13:31,683
Ha.

226
00:13:31,706 --> 00:13:35,344
Koʻpincha ishdan keyin kelib turasiz-ku.

227
00:13:35,367 --> 00:13:37,734
Ha, shunday.

228
00:13:37,757 --> 00:13:41,924
Har kuni kechgacha ishlashingizdan charchadingiz.

229
00:13:41,947 --> 00:13:44,280
Rahmat.

230
00:13:44,303 --> 00:13:48,103
Issiq choy ichib, dam oling.

231
00:13:48,126 --> 00:13:51,526
Ha, juda xursand boʻldim.

232
00:13:51,549 --> 00:13:53,560
Yana kelib turing.

233
00:13:53,583 --> 00:13:56,916
Ha, xayr.

234
00:13:56,939 --> 00:13:59,632
Doʻkondan chiqdim.

235
00:13:59,656 --> 00:14:04,289
Sotuvchi mening yuzimni eslab qoldi.

236
00:14:04,312 --> 00:14:09,179
Tokio katta va sovuq shahar deb oʻylardim.

237
00:14:09,203 --> 00:14:14,179
Lekin bu yerda ham kichik iliqliklar bor ekan.

238
00:14:14,203 --> 00:14:18,869
Qoʻlidagi choy juda issiq.

239
00:14:18,892 --> 00:14:23,726
Bu shahar menga ozgina oʻz shahrimdek tuyuldi.

240
00:14:23,749 --> 00:14:26,415
Tungi shamol esmoqda.

241
00:14:26,438 --> 00:14:29,476
Uyga qaytaman.

242
00:14:29,499 --> 00:14:30,999
Sahna 8: Dam olish kunidagi rasmlar / Dam olish kunida rasm chizish

243
00:14:30,999 --> 00:14:34,233
Bugun shanba.

244
00:14:34,255 --> 00:14:38,464
Men mahalla kafesida oʻtiraman.

245
00:14:38,488 --> 00:14:43,222
Dam olish kunidagi choy alohida mazali boʻladi.

246
00:14:43,245 --> 00:14:46,978
Derazaga yaqin joyda oʻtiraman.

247
00:14:47,001 --> 00:14:50,300
Rasm daftarimni ochaman.

248
00:14:50,323 --> 00:14:54,731
Rasm chizishni yaxshi koʻraman.

249
00:14:54,755 --> 00:14:58,922
Koʻchada yurgan odamlarni ruchkada chizamanku.

250
00:14:58,945 --> 00:15:02,878
Hamma qayerga ketayapti?

251
00:15:02,901 --> 00:15:05,868
Kim bilan uchrashishga?

252
00:15:05,891 --> 00:15:11,291
Mening rasmlarimda vaqt toʻxtaydi.

253
00:15:11,314 --> 00:15:13,247
Lin sizmisiz?

254
00:15:13,270 --> 00:15:16,404
E? Ah, Tanaka-san.

255
00:15:16,427 --> 00:15:19,002
Qanday tasodif!

256
00:15:19,025 --> 00:15:21,892
Bu yerga tez-tez tashrif buyurasizmi?

257
00:15:21,915 --> 00:15:26,163
Ha. Dam olish kunlarida tez-tez kelaman.

258
00:15:26,186 --> 00:15:28,459
Men ham shunday.

259
00:15:28,483 --> 00:15:30,931
Bu yerning qahvasi yoqadi shuning uchun.

260
00:15:30,955 --> 00:15:33,955
Tanaka-san, siz ham yolgʻizmisiz?

261
00:15:33,978 --> 00:15:35,578
Ha.

262
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:38,001
A, oʻtirishim mumkinmi?

263
00:15:38,024 --> 00:15:40,690
Ha, marhamat.

264
00:15:40,713 --> 00:15:43,890
Nima qilyapsiz?

265
00:15:43,914 --> 00:15:46,347
Rasm chizyapman.

266
00:15:46,370 --> 00:15:48,370
Koʻrsam boʻladimi?

267
00:15:48,393 --> 00:15:51,993
Ha, biroz uyatchanlik boʻladi, lekin.

268
00:15:52,016 --> 00:15:55,483
Vov, ajoyib ekan!

269
00:15:55,506 --> 00:15:57,949
Juda yaxshi chizgansiz.

270
00:15:57,972 --> 00:15:59,670
Rahmat.

271
00:15:59,693 --> 00:16:01,660
Bu mening xobim.

272
00:16:01,683 --> 00:16:04,450
Bu shaharning rasmi ekan-ku.

273
00:16:04,473 --> 00:16:06,806
Juda iliq rasm.

274
00:16:06,829 --> 00:16:11,029
Men bu shaharni yaxshi koʻraman.

275
00:16:11,052 --> 00:16:14,932
Buni eshitib, men ham xursand boʻldim.

276
00:16:14,955 --> 00:16:17,955
Tasodifiy uchrashuv boʻldi.

277
00:16:17,978 --> 00:16:23,912
Yaponiyada ish joyidagi odam bilan dam olish kunida uchrashishim birinchi marta.

278
00:16:23,935 --> 00:16:29,225
Mening eskiz daftarchimga yangi xotira qoʻshildi.

279
00:16:29,248 --> 00:16:33,848
Qahva bugun odatdagidan shirinroq tuyuldi.

280
00:16:33,871 --> 00:16:35,371
9-Sahna: Oy va Telefon Qoʻngʻirogʻi

281
00:16:35,371 --> 00:16:38,389
Kecha soat 10.

282
00:16:38,413 --> 00:16:42,980
Xonada yolgʻiz, karavotda oʻtirganman.

283
00:16:43,003 --> 00:16:47,536
Derazadan dumaloq oy koʻrinib turibdi.

284
00:16:47,559 --> 00:16:50,241
Oy birdan-bir.

285
00:16:50,264 --> 00:16:55,231
Amerikadan ham shu oy koʻrinadi.

286
00:16:55,254 --> 00:17:00,820
Baʼzan oilamning ovozi eshitishni juda xohlab qoʻyaman.

287
00:17:00,843 --> 00:17:05,534
Men smartfonimni olaman.

288
00:17:05,558 --> 00:17:09,533
Amerikadagi otamga qoʻngʻiroq qilaman.

289
00:17:09,556 --> 00:17:12,972
Alo, Lin.

290
00:17:12,996 --> 00:17:15,844
Ota, yaxshimisiz?

291
00:17:15,867 --> 00:17:20,001
O, Lin. Yaxshi.

292
00:17:20,024 --> 00:17:23,657
Hozir Amerikada soat necha?

293
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:26,755
Ertalab soat 8.

294
00:17:26,779 --> 00:17:29,182
Ishga ketishim kerak.

295
00:17:29,205 --> 00:17:30,846
Shundaymi.

296
00:17:30,870 --> 00:17:34,153
Band vaqtda uzr.

297
00:17:34,177 --> 00:17:36,985
Muammo yoʻq.

298
00:17:37,008 --> 00:17:39,304
Yaponiyada qanday?

299
00:17:39,327 --> 00:17:42,061
Juda qiziqarli.

300
00:17:42,084 --> 00:17:46,822
Baʼzan yolgʻizlik his qilaman, lekin harakat qilaman.

301
00:17:46,846 --> 00:17:50,248
Zoʻr berma.

302
00:17:50,271 --> 00:17:51,304
Ha.

303
00:17:51,327 --> 00:17:55,967
Ishga ham asta-sekin oʻrganib bordim.

304
00:17:55,991 --> 00:17:58,391
Bu yaxshi.

305
00:17:58,414 --> 00:18:03,104
Onang ham seni sogʻinib yuribdi.

306
00:18:03,127 --> 00:18:07,332
Onamga men yaxshi ekanligimni ayting.

307
00:18:07,355 --> 00:18:09,322
Tushunarli.

308
00:18:09,345 --> 00:18:12,594
Xayr, Rin.

309
00:18:12,618 --> 00:18:13,985
Rahmat.

310
00:18:14,008 --> 00:18:16,241
Xayr, yaxshi tun.

311
00:18:16,264 --> 00:18:18,831
Telefon uzildi.

312
00:18:18,854 --> 00:18:22,987
Xona yana tinchlandi.

313
00:18:23,010 --> 00:18:28,177
Lekin yuragim iliq.

314
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:32,285
Uzoqda boʻlsak ham, bir-birimizga bogʻlanganmiz.

315
00:18:32,308 --> 00:18:36,244
Men yolgʻiz emasman.

316
00:18:36,267 --> 00:18:41,234
Koʻp muhabbat meni qoʻriqlab turadi.

317
00:18:41,257 --> 00:18:45,108
Oy muloyim nur sochmoqda.

318
00:18:45,131 --> 00:18:48,531
Ertaga ham harakat qilishim kerak.

319
00:18:48,554 --> 00:18:50,054
Sahna 10: Yangi tongning birinchi qadami / A New Morning's First Step

320
00:18:50,054 --> 00:18:52,137
Tong otdi.

321
00:18:52,161 --> 00:18:55,166
Har doimgi kabi tong.

322
00:18:55,189 --> 00:18:58,990
Lekin bir narsa farq qiladi.

323
00:18:59,013 --> 00:19:05,413
Men endi bu shaharning shamolini sovuq deb oʻylamayman.

324
00:19:05,436 --> 00:19:09,470
Yangi poyabzal kiyaman.

325
00:19:09,493 --> 00:19:13,926
Eshikni ochib, tashqariga chiqaman.

326
00:19:13,949 --> 00:19:18,416
Quyosh nuri juda koʻrkam.

327
00:19:18,439 --> 00:19:24,306
Yaponiya kelganimdan beri yarim yil oʻtdi.

328
00:19:24,329 --> 00:19:27,179
Yigʻlagan kunlarim ham boʻldi.

329
00:19:27,203 --> 00:19:30,403
Kulgandek kunlarim ham boʻldi.

330
00:19:30,426 --> 00:19:35,237
Bularning barchasi mening qimmatli vaqtim.

331
00:19:35,261 --> 00:19:37,999
Poyezd stansiyasiga tomon yuraman.

332
00:19:38,023 --> 00:19:41,956
A, Rin-san. Xayrli tong!

333
00:19:41,979 --> 00:19:45,193
Tanaka-san. Xayrli tong!

334
00:19:45,217 --> 00:19:48,688
Bugungi ob-havo ajoyib, shunday emasmi?

335
00:19:48,711 --> 00:19:52,750
Ha, rostdan ham yaxshi.

336
00:19:52,774 --> 00:19:55,207
Bugun ham band kun boʻladi.

337
00:19:55,230 --> 00:19:58,164
Ha, tayyorman.

338
00:19:58,187 --> 00:20:00,320
Ishonchli ekansiz.

339
00:20:00,343 --> 00:20:04,030
Tanaka-san, har doim raxmat.

340
00:20:04,054 --> 00:20:06,903
Nima boʻldi, birdan?

341
00:20:06,926 --> 00:20:09,860
Yoʻq, aytmoqchi edim shunchaki.

342
00:20:09,883 --> 00:20:12,376
Keling, kompaniyaga boring.

343
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:15,041
Ha, boring.

344
00:20:15,064 --> 00:20:19,135
Men Rinman.

345
00:20:19,159 --> 00:20:22,526
Bu yer – Tokio.

346
00:20:22,549 --> 00:20:27,116
Til toʻsigʻi hali ham bor.

347
00:20:27,139 --> 00:20:32,005
Lekin, oshib boʻlmaydigan toʻsiq yoʻq.

348
00:20:32,028 --> 00:20:37,062
Men oʻz soʻzim bilan aytaman.

349
00:20:37,085 --> 00:20:42,334
Men oʻz dizaynim bilan yashayman.

350
00:20:42,358 --> 00:20:47,295
Mening hikoyam shu yerdan boshlanadi.

351
00:20:47,318 --> 00:20:52,756
Bugun ham yangi kun boshlanadi.

352
00:21:02,416 --> 00:21:03,916
Sahna 1: Yangi kunning boshlanishi

353
00:21:03,916 --> 00:21:07,312
Eshitish testi

354
00:21:07,312 --> 00:21:11,289
Koʻzlarimni ochaman.

355
00:21:11,289 --> 00:21:16,789
V ni + V mas = qilmoq...
Koʻz = koʻz 
Ochmoq ↔ Yopmoq

356
00:21:16,812 --> 00:21:20,712
Eshitish testi

357
00:21:20,712 --> 00:21:25,305
Oq ship koʻrinadi.

358
00:21:25,305 --> 00:21:31,605
N + koʻrinadi = N ni koʻrish mumkin
Ship = ship

359
00:21:31,628 --> 00:21:35,761
Eshitish testi

360
00:21:35,761 --> 00:21:40,661
Bu yer – Tokio.

361
00:21:40,661 --> 00:21:47,361
N1 + N2 = N1 — N2
Bu yer = bu yer

362
00:21:47,384 --> 00:21:51,818
Eshitish testi

363
00:21:51,818 --> 00:21:57,084
Mening ismim Rin.

364
00:21:57,084 --> 00:22:04,265
N1 ning + N2 = N1 ning N2 si
Ism = ism

365
00:22:04,289 --> 00:22:07,522
Eshitish testi

366
00:22:07,522 --> 00:22:11,258
Men Amerikadan kelganman.

367
00:22:11,258 --> 00:22:16,424
N dan + keldim = N dan kelganman
Kelmoq = kelmoq

368
00:22:16,447 --> 00:22:19,955
Eshitish testi

369
00:22:19,955 --> 00:22:24,073
Xona juda tinch.

370
00:22:24,073 --> 00:22:29,740
na A desu = ...dir/...dirlar
Xona (へや) = xona
Tinch (静か) (jim) ↔ Shovqinli (賑やか) (shovqinli)

371
00:22:29,763 --> 00:22:34,149
Eshitish testi

372
00:22:34,149 --> 00:22:39,382
Faqat soatning ovozi eshitiladi.

373
00:22:39,382 --> 00:22:46,496
Faqat N + が + eshitiladi = faqat N eshitiladi
Soat (時計) = soat
Ovoz (音) = tovush

374
00:22:46,519 --> 00:22:49,669
Eshitish testi

375
00:22:49,669 --> 00:22:53,345
Derazani ochaman.

376
00:22:53,345 --> 00:22:58,414
N ni + V (feʼl) = N ni qilmoq
Deraza (窓) = deraza

377
00:22:58,438 --> 00:23:02,908
Eshitish testi

378
00:23:02,908 --> 00:23:08,241
Sovuq shamol esadi.

379
00:23:08,241 --> 00:23:15,511
iA + N = sifat + ot
Sovuq (冷たい) (sovuq) ↔ Iliq (温かい) (iliq)
Shamol (風) = shamol

380
00:23:15,534 --> 00:23:19,801
Eshitish testi

381
00:23:19,801 --> 00:23:24,868
Yangi kun boshlanmoqda.

382
00:23:24,868 --> 00:23:31,771
N + boshlanadi = N boshlanadi
Yangi (新しい) (yangi) ↔ Eski (古い) (eski)
Boshlanmoq (始まる) = boshlanmoq

383
00:23:31,794 --> 00:23:36,827
Eshitish testi

384
00:23:36,827 --> 00:23:42,860
Bugun ham bu katta shaharda yashab ketaman.

385
00:23:42,860 --> 00:23:51,027
V (feʼl) + 続けます (davom ettirmoq) = ...ni davom ettirmoq
Katta (大きい) (katta) ↔ Kichik (小さい) (kichik)
Shahar (街) = shahar

386
00:23:51,050 --> 00:23:54,483
Eshitish testi

387
00:23:54,483 --> 00:23:58,517
Qahva ichaman.

388
00:23:58,517 --> 00:24:04,024
N ni + ichmoq = N ni ichmoq
Ichmoq (飲む) = ichmoq

389
00:24:04,048 --> 00:24:07,404
Eshitish testi

390
00:24:07,404 --> 00:24:11,339
Issiq ekan.

391
00:24:11,339 --> 00:24:16,772
iA desu = ...dir
Iliq (温かい) (iliq) ↔ Sovuq (冷たい) (sovuq)

392
00:24:16,795 --> 00:24:21,341
Eshitish testi

393
00:24:21,341 --> 00:24:26,774
Tayyorgarlik koʻrib, tashqariga chiqaman.

394
00:24:26,774 --> 00:24:34,167
V (feʼl) + qilib + V (feʼl) = ...qilib, ...qilmoq
Tayyorlash (準備) = tayyorlash
Tashqarida (外) (tashqarida) ↔ Ichkarida (中) (ichkarida)

395
00:24:34,191 --> 00:24:37,491
Eshitish testi

396
00:24:37,491 --> 00:24:41,357
Piyoda stansiyagacha boraman.

397
00:24:41,357 --> 00:24:46,659
N gacha = N gacha
Bekat (駅) = bekat
Yurmoq (歩く) = yurmoq

398
00:24:46,683 --> 00:24:50,383
Eshitish testi

399
00:24:50,383 --> 00:24:54,737
Koʻp odamlar bor.

400
00:24:54,737 --> 00:25:00,712
N koʻp + bor = N koʻp
Koʻp = koʻp

401
00:25:00,735 --> 00:25:04,835
Eshitish testi

402
00:25:04,835 --> 00:25:09,702
Hammasi qayerga ketayapti?

403
00:25:09,702 --> 00:25:16,369
N ga + borasizmi? = N ga borasizmi?
Bormoq (行く) (bormoq) ↔ Kelmoq (来る) (kelmoq)

404
00:25:16,392 --> 00:25:20,058
Eshitish testi

405
00:25:20,058 --> 00:25:24,369
Hech kim meni tanimaydi.

406
00:25:24,369 --> 00:25:30,277
Hech kim + V (feʼl) + emas = hech kim...
Hech kim (誰も) = hech kim
Bilmoq (知る) = bilmoq

407
00:25:30,301 --> 00:25:33,697
Eshitish testi

408
00:25:33,697 --> 00:25:37,683
Biroz yolgʻizlik his qilaman.

409
00:25:37,683 --> 00:25:43,183
Biroz + iA = bir oz...
Biroz (少し) = bir oz
Yolgʻiz (寂しい) = yolgʻiz

410
00:25:43,206 --> 00:25:47,874
Eshitish testi

411
00:25:47,874 --> 00:25:53,440
A, Rin-san, xayrli tong!

412
00:26:01,059 --> 00:26:05,937
Eshitish testi

413
00:26:05,937 --> 00:26:11,770
A, Tanaka-san, xayrli tong!

414
00:26:19,743 --> 00:26:22,610
Eshitish testi

415
00:26:22,610 --> 00:26:25,921
Bugun ham erta ekansiz.

416
00:26:25,921 --> 00:26:30,500
iA, shunday emasmi? = ..., shunday emasmi?
Erta (早い) (erta) ↔ Kech (遅い) (kech)

417
00:26:30,523 --> 00:26:35,190
Eshitish testi

418
00:26:35,190 --> 00:26:40,747
Ha, ertalabki havoni yaxshi koʻraman.

419
00:26:40,747 --> 00:26:48,327
N yoqadi, chunki = N yoqadi, chunki...
Ertalab (朝) (ertalab) ↔ Kechqurun (夜) (kechqurun)
Havo (空気) = havo

420
00:26:48,350 --> 00:26:51,784
Eshitish testi

421
00:26:51,784 --> 00:26:55,777
Shundaymi? Yaxshi ekan.

422
00:27:01,300 --> 00:27:05,600
Eshitish testi

423
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:10,709
Tanaka-san ham har doim erta turasiz-ku.

424
00:27:10,709 --> 00:27:17,680
N ham + iA = N ham...
Har doim (いつも) = har doim

425
00:27:17,703 --> 00:27:23,137
Eshitish testi

426
00:27:23,137 --> 00:27:29,656
Ha, men ertalabki poyezdni yaxshi koʻraman.

427
00:27:29,656 --> 00:27:38,530
N yoqadi = N yoqadi
Poyezd (電車) = poyezd
Yoqmoq (好き) (yoqmoq) ↔ Yoqtirmaslik (嫌い) (yoqtirmaslik)

428
00:27:38,553 --> 00:27:41,495
Eshitish testi

429
00:27:41,495 --> 00:27:44,929
Odam kam boʻladi-ku.

430
00:27:44,929 --> 00:27:49,642
...chunki = ...chunki
Koʻp (多い) (koʻp) ↔ Kam (少ない) (kam)

431
00:27:49,665 --> 00:27:55,365
Eshitish testi

432
00:27:55,365 --> 00:28:02,198
Shunday. Toʻla poyezddan biroz qoʻrqaman.

433
00:28:02,198 --> 00:28:11,498
N + iA = N...
Toʻla poyezd (満員電車) = toʻla poyezd
Qoʻrqinchli (怖い) = qoʻrqinchli

434
00:28:11,521 --> 00:28:16,317
Eshitish testi

435
00:28:16,317 --> 00:28:22,050
Yaponlar ham toʻla poyezdni yoqtirishmaydi.

436
00:28:22,050 --> 00:28:29,837
N yoqmaydi = N yoqmaydi
Yapon (日本人) = yapon

437
00:28:29,861 --> 00:28:33,577
Eshitish testi

438
00:28:33,577 --> 00:28:37,955
Shundaymi? Yengil boʻldim.

439
00:28:37,955 --> 00:28:43,953
V (feʼl) + qildim = ...qildim
Xotirjam boʻlish (安心する) = xotirjam boʻlish

440
00:28:43,976 --> 00:28:46,914
Eshitish testi

441
00:28:46,914 --> 00:28:50,348
Poyezd keldi-ku.

442
00:28:50,348 --> 00:28:55,081
Keldim! = Keldim!
Kelmoq (来る) = kelmoq

443
00:28:55,104 --> 00:28:58,494
Eshitish testi

444
00:28:58,494 --> 00:29:02,463
Ha, birga boring.

445
00:29:02,463 --> 00:29:07,930
Birga + V (feʼl) + qilaylik = birga ... qilaylik
Birga (一緒に) = birga

446
00:29:07,953 --> 00:29:11,553
Eshitish testi

447
00:29:11,553 --> 00:29:15,819
Tanaka-sanning ovozi eshitildi.

448
00:29:15,819 --> 00:29:21,653
N ni + eshitdim = N ni eshitdim
Ovoz (声) = ovoz
Eshitmoq (聞く) = eshitmoq

449
00:29:21,676 --> 00:29:26,212
Eshitish testi

450
00:29:26,212 --> 00:29:31,645
Yolgʻizlik hissi biroz yoʻqoldi.

451
00:29:31,645 --> 00:29:39,019
N yoʻqoldi = N yoʻqoldi
His-tuygʻu (気持ち) = his-tuygʻu
Yoʻqolmoq (消える) = yoʻqolmoq

452
00:29:39,042 --> 00:29:42,520
Eshitish testi

453
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:46,596
Men yolgʻiz emasman.

454
00:29:46,596 --> 00:29:52,230
N emasman = N emasman
Yolgʻiz (一人) = yolgʻiz

455
00:29:52,253 --> 00:29:55,953
Eshitish testi

456
00:29:55,953 --> 00:30:00,286
Bugun ham ishga boraman.

457
00:30:00,286 --> 00:30:06,219
N ga + bormoq = N ga bormoq
Ish (仕事) = ish

458
00:30:06,242 --> 00:30:07,742
Sahna 2: Kanji toʻsigʻi va ish

459
00:30:07,742 --> 00:30:10,682
Eshitish testi

460
00:30:10,682 --> 00:30:14,116
Ofisga yetib keldim.

461
00:30:14,116 --> 00:30:18,816
N ga yetib keldim = N ga yetib keldim
Kompaniya (会社) = kompaniya

462
00:30:18,839 --> 00:30:21,595
Eshitish testi

463
00:30:21,595 --> 00:30:24,772
Kompyuterni ochaman.

464
00:30:24,772 --> 00:30:29,205
N ni + ochmoq = N ni ochmoq
Ochmoq (開く) (ochmoq) ↔ Yopmoq (閉じる) (yopmoq)

465
00:30:29,228 --> 00:30:32,561
Eshitish testi

466
00:30:32,561 --> 00:30:36,461
Koʻp xatlar bor.

467
00:30:36,461 --> 00:30:41,819
N bor = N bor
Koʻp = koʻp

468
00:30:41,843 --> 00:30:45,237
Eshitish testi

469
00:30:45,237 --> 00:30:49,206
Hammasi yaponcha.

470
00:30:49,206 --> 00:30:54,673
N dir = N dir
Hammasi (全部) = hammasi

471
00:30:54,696 --> 00:30:58,662
Eshitish testi

472
00:30:58,662 --> 00:31:03,362
Kanji haqiqatan ham qiyin.

473
00:31:03,362 --> 00:31:09,796
iA = iA
Qiyin (難しい) (qiyin) ↔ Oson (易しい) (oson)

474
00:31:09,819 --> 00:31:14,052
Eshitish testi

475
00:31:14,052 --> 00:31:19,085
Men dizayn bilan shugʻullanaman.

476
00:31:19,085 --> 00:31:25,952
V (feʼl) + qilmoqdaman = ... qilmoqdaman
Ish (仕事) = ish

477
00:31:25,975 --> 00:31:29,042
Eshitish testi

478
00:31:29,042 --> 00:31:32,584
Dizayn men uchun oson.

479
00:31:32,584 --> 00:31:37,484
N da yaxshi = N da yaxshi
Yaxshi (得意) (yaxshi) ↔ Yomon (苦手) (yomon)

480
00:31:37,506 --> 00:31:41,573
Eshitish testi

481
00:31:41,573 --> 00:31:46,367
Ammo til toʻsigʻi baland.

482
00:31:46,367 --> 00:31:52,916
N1 ning N2 si = N1 ning N2 si
Soʻz (言葉) = soʻz
Baland (高い) (baland) ↔ Past (低い) (past)

483
00:31:52,940 --> 00:31:56,806
Eshitish testi

484
00:31:56,806 --> 00:32:01,347
Baʼzan yigʻlamoqchiman boʻladi.

485
00:32:01,347 --> 00:32:07,581
V (feʼl) + qilishni xohlayman = ... qilishni xohlayman
Baʼzan (時々) = baʼzan
Yigʻlamoq (泣く) = yigʻlamoq

486
00:32:07,604 --> 00:32:11,070
Eshitish testi

487
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:15,137
Katta nafas chiqadi.

488
00:32:15,137 --> 00:32:20,719
N chiqadi = N chiqadi
Katta (大きい) (katta) ↔ Kichik (小さい) (kichik)
Kuf (ため息) = kuf

489
00:32:20,743 --> 00:32:24,243
Eshitish testi

490
00:32:24,243 --> 00:32:28,348
Rin-san, hammasi joyidami?

491
00:32:28,348 --> 00:32:33,981
naA siz? = Siz naA misiz?
Yaxshi (大丈夫) = yaxshi

492
00:32:34,004 --> 00:32:39,271
Eshitish testi

493
00:32:39,271 --> 00:32:45,586
Oh, Tanaka-san. Ha, hammasi joyida.

494
00:32:54,242 --> 00:32:58,342
Eshitish testi

495
00:32:58,342 --> 00:33:03,179
Katta nafas olayotgan edingiz-ku.

496
00:33:03,179 --> 00:33:09,812
V (feʼl) + qilayotgan edim = ... qilayotgan edim
Kuf urmoq (ため息をつく) = kuf urmoq

497
00:33:09,835 --> 00:33:15,069
Eshitish testi

498
00:33:15,069 --> 00:33:21,306
Kechirasiz. Kanji biroz qiyinroq ekan.

499
00:33:21,306 --> 00:33:29,818
iA = iA
Biroz (少し) = bir oz

500
00:33:29,841 --> 00:33:32,508
Eshitish testi

501
00:33:32,508 --> 00:33:35,574
Qaysi kanji?

502
00:33:35,574 --> 00:33:39,808
Qaysi N? = Qaysi N?

503
00:33:39,831 --> 00:33:43,189
Eshitish testi

504
00:33:43,189 --> 00:33:47,122
Bu elektron pochtadagi kanji.

505
00:33:47,122 --> 00:33:52,555
Bu N = Bu N

506
00:33:52,578 --> 00:33:58,012
Eshitish testi

507
00:33:58,012 --> 00:34:04,512
A, bu „tasdiqlash“ deb oʻqiladi.

508
00:34:04,512 --> 00:34:13,345
N deb + oʻqiladi = N deb oʻqiladi
Tasdiqlash (確認) = tasdiqlash

509
00:34:13,368 --> 00:34:16,201
Eshitish testi

510
00:34:16,201 --> 00:34:19,471
„Kakunin“, desangiz?

511
00:34:19,471 --> 00:34:24,005
N mi? = N mi?

512
00:34:24,028 --> 00:34:28,566
Eshitish testi

513
00:34:28,566 --> 00:34:33,999
Ha. „Tekshirish“ degan maʼnoni bildiradi.

514
00:34:33,999 --> 00:34:41,370
V (feʼl) + degan maʼnoni bildiradi = ... degan maʼnoni bildiradi
Maʼno (意味) = maʼno

515
00:34:41,393 --> 00:34:43,909
Eshitish testi

516
00:34:43,909 --> 00:34:46,781
Tushunarli. Rahmat.

517
00:34:50,838 --> 00:34:53,756
Eshitish testi

518
00:34:53,756 --> 00:34:57,138
Lugʻatdan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

519
00:34:57,138 --> 00:35:01,804
V (feʼl) + qilish mumkin = V (feʼl) qilish mumkin
Lugʻat (辞書) = lugʻat

520
00:35:01,827 --> 00:35:05,461
Eshitish testi

521
00:35:05,461 --> 00:35:09,727
Ha, doimo foydalanaman.

522
00:35:09,727 --> 00:35:15,561
V (feʼl) + qilaman (odatda) = ... qilaman (odatda)
Har doim (いつも) = har doim

523
00:35:15,584 --> 00:35:19,617
Eshitish testi

524
00:35:19,617 --> 00:35:24,399
Nimadir tushunmaganingizda, istalgan vaqtda soʻrang.

525
00:35:24,399 --> 00:35:30,932
Iltimos, V (feʼl) + qiling = Iltimos, ... qiling
Har vaqt (いつでも) = har vaqt

526
00:35:30,955 --> 00:35:34,927
Eshitish testi

527
00:35:34,927 --> 00:35:39,627
Tanaka-san har doim mehribon.

528
00:35:39,627 --> 00:35:46,061
iA = iA
Mehribon (優しい) (mehribon) ↔ Qattiq (厳しい) (qattiq)

529
00:35:46,084 --> 00:35:50,317
Eshitish testi

530
00:35:50,317 --> 00:35:55,350
Bir jamoamiz-ku. Albatta.

531
00:35:55,350 --> 00:36:02,225
~dan / ~ uchun = chunki / chunki...
Bir xil ↔ Turli (turlicha)
Albatta = tabiiyki / albatta

532
00:36:02,249 --> 00:36:05,239
Eshitish testi

533
00:36:05,239 --> 00:36:08,739
Rostdan yordam berasiz.

534
00:36:08,739 --> 00:36:13,533
Yordam bermoq = qutqarilmoq / yordam olmoq

535
00:36:13,556 --> 00:36:17,190
Eshitish testi

536
00:36:17,190 --> 00:36:21,456
Bugun tushdan keyin yigʻilish bor-ku.

537
00:36:21,456 --> 00:36:27,290
N bor / boʻladi
Ertalab ↔ Tushdan keyin
Yigʻilish = yigʻilish, majlis

538
00:36:27,313 --> 00:36:30,813
Eshitish testi

539
00:36:30,813 --> 00:36:34,913
Ha, hujjatlar tayyor.

540
00:36:34,913 --> 00:36:40,546
N tayyor = N tayyor boʻldi
Hujjatlar = hujjat / material

541
00:36:40,569 --> 00:36:44,202
Eshitish testi

542
00:36:44,202 --> 00:36:48,469
Keyinroq koʻrsatib qoʻying.

543
00:36:48,469 --> 00:36:54,336
V(feʼl)ing → V(feʼl)ing iltimos
Keyinroq ↔ Oldin

544
00:36:54,359 --> 00:36:57,059
Eshitish testi

545
00:36:57,059 --> 00:37:00,164
Tushunarli.

546
00:37:04,489 --> 00:37:09,525
Eshitish testi

547
00:37:09,525 --> 00:37:15,559
Men yolgʻiz ishlamayapman.

548
00:37:15,559 --> 00:37:23,792
~ emas = bu ... emas
Yolgʻiz (bir kishi) ↔ Koʻp odamlar

549
00:37:23,815 --> 00:37:26,848
Eshitish testi

550
00:37:26,848 --> 00:37:30,354
Yordam beradigan odamlar bor.

551
00:37:30,354 --> 00:37:35,221
V(feʼl)ib beradigan N = menga V(feʼl)ni bajaradigan N
Yordam bermoq = yordam / qutqarish

552
00:37:35,244 --> 00:37:39,630
Eshitish testi

553
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:44,863
Shuning uchun koʻproq oʻrganmoqchiman.

554
00:37:44,863 --> 00:37:51,998
V(feʼl)moqchiman = V(feʼl)ni xohlayman
Oʻqimoq = oʻqish

555
00:37:52,022 --> 00:37:56,526
Eshitish testi

556
00:37:56,526 --> 00:38:01,893
Yapon tilini yanada yaxshi gaplashmoqchiman.

557
00:38:01,893 --> 00:38:09,226
NaA (sifat) holatda V(feʼl)moqchiman = NaA (sifat) tarzda V(feʼl)ni xohlayman
Mohir (usti) ↔ Noʻnoq (usti boʻlmagan)

558
00:38:09,249 --> 00:38:11,995
Eshitish testi

559
00:38:11,995 --> 00:38:15,166
Bugun ham harakat qilaman.

560
00:38:15,166 --> 00:38:19,559
N ham V(feʼl)adi = ham V(feʼl)ni bajaradi
Harakat qilmoq = oʻzining eng yaxshi natijasini koʻrsatmoq

561
00:38:19,582 --> 00:38:21,082
3-Sahna: Parkda tushlik / Parkda tushlik

562
00:38:21,082 --> 00:38:24,216
Eshitish testi

563
00:38:24,216 --> 00:38:27,882
Tushlik vaqti.

564
00:38:27,882 --> 00:38:32,916
N + uchun + vaqt = N uchun vaqt
Tushlik = tushlik / Vaqt = vaqt

565
00:38:32,939 --> 00:38:35,893
Eshitish testi

566
00:38:35,893 --> 00:38:39,326
Men parkdayapman.

567
00:38:39,326 --> 00:38:44,068
N + da + turmoq = N da boʻlmoq
Bogʻ = bogʻ

568
00:38:44,092 --> 00:38:47,592
Eshitish testi

569
00:38:47,592 --> 00:38:51,692
Bugun ob-havo yaxshi.

570
00:38:51,692 --> 00:38:57,325
N + yaxshi = N yaxshi
Ob-havo = ob-havo / Bugun ↔ Ertaga

571
00:38:57,348 --> 00:39:00,415
Eshitish testi

572
00:39:00,415 --> 00:39:03,964
Osmon juda ham koʻk.

573
00:39:03,964 --> 00:39:08,864
iA (sifat) + dir = iA (sifat)dir
Osmon = osmon / Koʻk = koʻk

574
00:39:08,887 --> 00:39:12,387
Eshitish testi

575
00:39:12,387 --> 00:39:16,462
Amerikadagi osmonni eslatadi.

576
00:39:16,462 --> 00:39:22,059
N + ni + eslamoq = N ni eslamoq
Eslamoq = eslamoq

577
00:39:22,082 --> 00:39:25,752
Eshitish testi

578
00:39:25,752 --> 00:39:30,086
Men bentō tayyorladim.

579
00:39:30,086 --> 00:39:36,005
V(feʼl)dim = V(feʼl)ni qildim
Bento = uyga olib ketiladigan tushlik / Tayyorlamoq = tayyorlamoq

580
00:39:36,028 --> 00:39:40,094
Eshitish testi

581
00:39:40,094 --> 00:39:44,879
Tuxumli omlet va onigiri.

582
00:39:44,879 --> 00:39:51,436
N1 + va + N2 = N1 va N2
Qaymoqli omlet

583
00:39:51,460 --> 00:39:55,927
Eshitish testi

584
00:39:55,927 --> 00:40:01,227
Yapon taomlari juda ham chiroyli.

585
00:40:01,227 --> 00:40:08,460
NaA (sifat) + dir = NaA (sifat)dir
Ovqat = ovqat

586
00:40:08,483 --> 00:40:11,717
Eshitish testi

587
00:40:11,717 --> 00:40:15,471
Yeyishga arziydi.

588
00:40:15,471 --> 00:40:20,652
V(feʼl)moq + bekor = V(feʼl)ni bajarish bekor
Bekor = behuda, juda yaxshi

589
00:40:20,675 --> 00:40:24,747
Eshitish testi

590
00:40:24,747 --> 00:40:29,580
Rin-san. Bu yer yaxshimi?

591
00:40:29,580 --> 00:40:36,159
N + yaxshi boʻladi mi? = N yaxshi boʻladi mi?

592
00:40:36,182 --> 00:40:40,518
Eshitish testi

593
00:40:40,518 --> 00:40:45,671
Tanaka-san. Ha, marhamat.

594
00:40:52,761 --> 00:40:57,628
Eshitish testi

595
00:40:57,628 --> 00:41:03,419
Tashqarida yeyiladigan ovqat mazali boʻladi-ku.

596
00:41:03,419 --> 00:41:11,319
V(feʼl)adigan N = V(feʼl)ni bajaradigan N
Tashqarida ↔ Ichkarida / Guruch = ovqat, guruch

597
00:41:11,342 --> 00:41:15,480
Eshitish testi

598
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:20,390
Ha. Shamol yoqimli.

599
00:41:20,390 --> 00:41:27,090
N + yoqimli = N yoqimli
Shamol = shamol / Yoqimli = qulay, yoqimli

600
00:41:27,113 --> 00:41:31,347
Eshitish testi

601
00:41:31,347 --> 00:41:36,380
Rin-san, sizning bentongiz ajoyib ekan-ku.

602
00:41:36,380 --> 00:41:43,259
N + a? = N, shunday emasmi?
Ajoyib = ajoyib, zoʻr

603
00:41:43,282 --> 00:41:46,382
Eshitish testi

604
00:41:46,382 --> 00:41:50,015
Oʻzim tayyorladim.

605
00:41:50,015 --> 00:41:54,966
Oʻzi = oʻzi bilan
Oʻzi = oʻzi

606
00:41:54,990 --> 00:41:58,896
Eshitish testi

607
00:41:58,896 --> 00:42:03,530
Tuxumli omlet chiroyli.

608
00:42:03,530 --> 00:42:09,845
NaA (sifat) + dir = NaA (sifat)dir

609
00:42:09,868 --> 00:42:12,101
Eshitish testi

610
00:42:12,101 --> 00:42:14,635
Rahmat.

611
00:42:18,173 --> 00:42:22,507
Eshitish testi

612
00:42:22,507 --> 00:42:27,640
Lekin, taʼmi biroz xavotirda.

613
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:34,673
N + haqida + xavotirda = N haqida xavotirda
Taʼm = taʼm, lazzat / Xavotir = xavotir, tashvish

614
00:42:34,696 --> 00:42:38,208
Eshitish testi

615
00:42:38,208 --> 00:42:42,325
Bitta olsam boʻladi-mi?

616
00:42:42,325 --> 00:42:47,992
V(feʼl)sam + boʻladi mi? = V(feʼl)sam boʻladi mi?
Bitta = bitta

617
00:42:48,015 --> 00:42:51,282
Eshitish testi

618
00:42:51,282 --> 00:42:55,115
Ha, marhamat.

619
00:43:00,405 --> 00:43:02,745
Eshitish testi

620
00:43:02,745 --> 00:43:05,416
Sinab koʻring.

621
00:43:05,416 --> 00:43:09,126
V(feʼl)ib + koʻring → V(feʼl)ib koʻring iltimos

622
00:43:09,149 --> 00:43:11,697
Eshitish testi

623
00:43:11,697 --> 00:43:14,616
Yeyapman.

624
00:43:18,706 --> 00:43:23,098
Eshitish testi

625
00:43:23,098 --> 00:43:28,331
Mmm, juda mazali.

626
00:43:28,331 --> 00:43:35,471
iA (sifat) + dir = iA (sifat)dir

627
00:43:35,495 --> 00:43:37,761
Eshitish testi

628
00:43:37,761 --> 00:43:40,301
Rostdanmi?

629
00:43:40,301 --> 00:43:43,868
Rostdanmi? = Rostdanmi?
Rost = haqiqat, voqelik

630
00:43:43,891 --> 00:43:46,424
Eshitish testi

631
00:43:46,424 --> 00:43:49,324
Yaxshi boʻldi.

632
00:43:49,324 --> 00:43:53,358
Yaxshi boʻldi = Xursand boʻldim

633
00:43:53,381 --> 00:43:57,727
Eshitish testi

634
00:43:57,727 --> 00:44:02,893
Bir oz shirin, juda mazali.

635
00:44:02,893 --> 00:44:09,960
iA (sifat) va
Shirin ↔ Achchiq / Bir oz ↔ Koʻp

636
00:44:09,983 --> 00:44:14,167
Eshitish testi

637
00:44:14,167 --> 00:44:19,142
Bir kun Amerika taomlarini ham pishiraman.

638
00:44:19,142 --> 00:44:25,935
Qachondir + V(feʼl)aman = Qachondir V(feʼl)ni qilaman
Pishirish = pishirish, taom / Qachondir = qachondir

639
00:44:25,958 --> 00:44:28,876
Eshitish testi

640
00:44:28,876 --> 00:44:32,262
Shu kunni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

641
00:44:32,262 --> 00:44:36,941
Kutib qolmoqdaman = intizorlik bilan kutmoqdaman
Quvnoq = zavq, kutish

642
00:44:36,964 --> 00:44:41,631
Eshitish testi

643
00:44:41,631 --> 00:44:47,179
Kimdir men tayyorlagan taomni yeyapti.

644
00:44:47,179 --> 00:44:54,752
V(feʼl)gan + narsa = V(feʼl)gan narsa
Kimdir = kimdir

645
00:44:54,776 --> 00:44:58,276
Eshitish testi

646
00:44:58,276 --> 00:45:02,386
Mazali ekanligini aytishadi.

647
00:45:02,386 --> 00:45:08,052
V(feʼl)ib + beradi = menga V(feʼl)ni qiladi
Aytmoq = aytmoq, gapirmoq

648
00:45:08,075 --> 00:45:12,642
Eshitish testi

649
00:45:12,642 --> 00:45:18,109
Shu soʻzlar mening yuragimni toʻldiradi.

650
00:45:18,109 --> 00:45:25,542
N + ni + toʻldirmoq = N ni toʻldirmoq
Soʻz = soʻz, til / Yurak = yurak, ong

651
00:45:25,565 --> 00:45:31,507
Eshitish testi

652
00:45:31,507 --> 00:45:38,677
Kichkina bentō qutisida mening joyim bor.

653
00:45:38,677 --> 00:45:48,394
N + ichida + joy + bor = N ichida joy bor
Bento qutisi = tushlik qutisi / Joy = oʻz joyi

654
00:45:48,418 --> 00:45:52,290
Eshitish testi

655
00:45:52,290 --> 00:45:56,863
Tushdan keyin ham ishni davom ettirishga quvvatim bordek.

656
00:45:56,863 --> 00:46:03,131
V(feʼl)dek + koʻrinadi = V(feʼl)dek koʻrinadi
Tushdan keyin ↔ Ertalab / Ish = ish, kasb

657
00:46:03,154 --> 00:46:04,654
4-Sahna: Xatolar va kayfiyatni oʻzgartirish / Xatolarni yengish va kayfiyatni oʻzgartirish

658
00:46:04,654 --> 00:46:08,800
Eshitish testi

659
00:46:08,800 --> 00:46:13,718
Tushdan keyin soat uch.

660
